nt-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRI9WYEaNQjk40fuXeIJeZaqsrYyIYxIJa8JGH9JLURkw&oe=6B09B101"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Chimpanzee Chase Projects", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Chimpanzee Chase is an exhilarating virtual reality game that thrusts players into the heart of a bustling jungle as intelligent chimpanzees on a thrilling adventure. The immersive VR experience allows players to swing from vines, navigate intricate tree canopies, and engage in dynamic, fast-paced chases through the lush landscape. What sets Chimpanzee Chase apart is its groundbreaking communication system, enabling players to talk to each other in real-time using an advanced vocalization translation feature. This not only enhances teamwork during the pursuit of various challenges but also creates a unique social dynamic as players strategize and communicate while swinging through the virtual jungle. The game offers a seamless blend of action and cooperative gameplay, allowing players to experience the excitement of being a chimpanzee in a vibrant, interactive world while fostering a sense of camaraderie through communication. Chimpanzee Chase is set to redefine the boundaries of VR gaming, providing an unforgettable and socially engaging experience for players.", "short_description": "You can play as a chimpanzee with voice chat and meet other people!"}]}, "developer_name": "Waterbel", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://waterbel.wixsite.com/watergames/kopie-van-chimpanzee-chase", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Waterbel", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://waterbel.wixsite.com/watergames", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_conn